OL,3,GNEWSA'Bring it on' - Cardiff businesses
OL,4,Areact to Fury vs Joshua rumours
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Bring it on, we are ready and
OL,7,Fwaiting."
OL,9,FThose are the words of one Cardiff bar
OL,10,Fmanager as rumours grow that the
OL,11,FPrincipality Stadium could be the new
OL,12,Ffront-runner to host Anthony Joshua's
OL,13,Fclash with Tyson Fury.
OL,15,FBBC Sport understands the Cardiff venue
OL,16,Fis being considered as an alternative
OL,17,Fto New York's Madison Square Garden and
OL,18,FWembley Stadium, sparking excitement
OL,19,Famong the Welsh capital's bars and
OL,20,Frestaurants.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
